     "id": "ab41f931",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\" data-el=\"page.hero\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap page-hero__grid\">\n    <div class=\"page-hero__text\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow-rule\">Neurodiversity Access &amp; Opportunity</p>\n      <h1 class=\"h1 split-words\" aria-label=\"Different Minds. Equal Opportunity.\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:0\">Different</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:1\">Minds.</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:2\">Equal</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:3\">Opportunity.</span></span></span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">AFSV VRC is developing an inclusive ecosystem intended to expand access to sport, education, developmental support, life skills, technology and employment for neurodivergent people. Through qualified professionals, community organizations, businesses, sponsors and employers, the program intends to reduce financial and accessibility barriers.</p>\n      <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"#interest\">Get Support / Register Interest<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/service-provider-network/}}\">Become a Service Provider<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/business-for-inclusion/}}\">Become a Neuroinclusive Employer<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/neurodiversity-access-fund/}}\">Sponsor Access<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"page-hero__media\" data-video-scope><div class=\"pmedia\" data-video=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JOGRzagxf8GC6k15VlPoOU7fkd/hf_20261001_224018_4e356870-32e3-48b3-a7c9-92569c2d9918.mp4\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"><img src=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JOGRzagxf8GC6k15VlPoOU7fkd/hf_20260916_033952_5bd97c4a-d10b-42a6-bbe7-7ac994157e58.png\" alt=\"Five adults of varied backgrounds in a loose circle doing a low-intensity warm-up led by a coach in a calm indoor hall; one participant wears noise-reducing earmuffs and another moves at their own pace, clearly included.\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
