      "html": "<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.mandatory-note\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-top:56px\"><p class=\"note\" role=\"note\">AFSV VRC does not provide clinical diagnosis, assessment or therapeutic treatment. Regulated services are delivered only by qualified professionals who are reviewed separately, and the public form does not ask for diagnoses or medical records.</p></section>"
